    "version": "9.8.9.29",
    "scope": "Three signed-in loads on 2026-11-26 (runs r1, r2, r3) of Enhanced-data-model site pages in the Default studio template whose copy holds one codecomponent tag naming an invented field control by its customcontrol id in five written forms (the environment id is replaced by one invented id in the copy and in the observed id map), followed by a marker paragraph. Establishes how many code component hosts the served page has and whether it keeps the copy after the tag; not the host markup, the arguments or client behaviour."
